</svg>
<div style="color:#e91e63; font-weight:bold; letter-spacing:4px;">DEEP ABYSS</div>
<div style="color:#666; font-size:12px; margin-top:10px;">点击任意位置进入深渊</div>
</div>
<div class="header">
